# Database schema

- Only `database-engineer` edits models, Alembic revisions, and seed data.
- A model change ships with a revision whose `downgrade` reverses it.
- Index `last_name`, `status`, `last_visit_at`, and `(patient_id, noted_at DESC)`.
- `status` and `blood_type` are enums. Timestamps are `timestamptz`.
- Notes use `ON DELETE CASCADE`. Seed is idempotent and inserts at least 20 patients.
